  "This script is unavailable. Browser JavaScript, server Python and server JavaScript with execution permission are supported.": "This script is unavailable. Browser JavaScript, server Python and server JavaScript with execution permission are supported.",
  "Browser JavaScript runs with context, project, searchType, searchKeys, rpc(method, args, kwargs) and refresh(). Server Python uses the existing TACTIC server API; its print output remains in the server log. Server JavaScript uses the native server API synchronously through server; kwargs become globals. It runs in QuickJS-NG, without browser or DCC access.": "Browser JavaScript runs with context, project, searchType, searchKeys, rpc(method, args, kwargs) and refresh(). Server Python uses the existing TACTIC server API; its print output remains in the server log. Server JavaScript uses the native server API synchronously through server; kwargs become globals. It runs in QuickJS-NG, without browser or DCC access.",
  "Restrict HTML widget classes": "Restrict HTML widget classes",
  "Apply native builtin widget rules and bound widget-key arguments. HTML execution still requires administrator access.": "Apply native builtin widget rules and bound widget-key arguments. HTML execution still requires administrator access.",
